# Artwork copied from the Dashie site by tools/port-from-dashie.mjs.
# NOT committed, for two independent reasons:
#   1. These are Dashie product screenshots renamed to chickadee-*.png. They are
#      Dashie-branded INSIDE the pixels, so publishing them here would look like
#      passing Dashie's UI off as Chickadee's — the exact rebadge this project is
#      designed against (see README, "The Dashie screenshots are deliberately not
#      reused"). They exist locally so the ported LAYOUT renders for review.
#   2. 55 MB of binaries would be permanent in a public repo's history.
# Re-create at any time with: node tools/port-from-dashie.mjs
